WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.009
In about two minutes, you will set up a contest your way, with judges and a prize.

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:09.242
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:13.468
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:15.958
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:17.303
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.047 --> 00:00:21.263
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.263 --> 00:00:21.914
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.437 --> 00:00:27.933
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:29.151
See the three dots?

00:00:29.151 --> 00:00:29.698
Tap them.

00:00:31.303 --> 00:00:32.882
In the menu, tap Add.

00:00:34.655 --> 00:00:35.838
Three choices.

00:00:35.838 --> 00:00:36.942
Tap A contest.

00:00:38.774 --> 00:00:40.050
Name your contest.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.862
Type a name, then tap Next.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:45.985
Who is running it?

00:00:45.985 --> 00:00:48.687
Type the name, pick your city, then tap Next.

00:00:51.744 --> 00:00:54.320
This welcome message is already written.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.703
Keep it, and tap Next.

00:00:57.508 --> 00:00:59.235
A website is optional.

00:00:59.235 --> 00:01:00.886
Skip it, and tap Next.

00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:05.104
These dates are filled in for you.

00:01:05.104 --> 00:01:05.693
Tap Next.

00:01:07.746 --> 00:01:09.711
Choose Customize everything.

00:01:09.711 --> 00:01:10.660
Then tap Next.

00:01:13.228 --> 00:01:14.895
Add your own category.

00:01:14.895 --> 00:01:15.910
Then tap Next.

00:01:19.341 --> 00:01:20.316
Who can vote?

00:01:20.316 --> 00:01:22.475
We choose Everyone and judges.

00:01:22.475 --> 00:01:23.451
Then tap Next.

00:01:26.005 --> 00:01:29.251
Add your judges, one email on each line.

00:01:29.251 --> 00:01:30.359
Then tap Next.

00:01:33.098 --> 00:01:34.248
Choose score.

00:01:34.248 --> 00:01:35.397
Then tap Next.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.256
Keep the default.

00:01:39.256 --> 00:01:39.914
Tap Next.

00:01:42.086 --> 00:01:43.402
Keep the default.

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:44.060
Tap Next.

00:01:46.213 --> 00:01:47.529
Keep the default.

00:01:47.529 --> 00:01:48.187
Tap Next.

00:01:50.365 --> 00:01:51.238
Add a prize.

00:01:51.238 --> 00:01:53.523
We give each winner the same one.

00:01:53.523 --> 00:01:54.463
Then tap Next.

00:01:58.268 --> 00:01:59.864
Your rules are written.

00:01:59.864 --> 00:02:00.462
Tap Next.

00:02:02.624 --> 00:02:05.260
Check everything, and tap Create contest.

00:02:07.715 --> 00:02:09.364
Your contest is live!

00:02:09.364 --> 00:02:11.013
Tap Open my dashboard.

00:02:12.953 --> 00:02:17.330
This is your dashboard, with your link and QR code, ready to share.

00:02:18.532 --> 00:02:21.040
Next up: Share your contest.
